    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "_Time_ as an **occasion** is **vez**. Plural: **veces** (z becomes c). It's feminine: **una vez**, **la primera vez**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "English",
            "Spanish"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "once",
              "una vez"
            ],
            [
              "twice",
              "dos veces"
            ],
            [
              "many times, often",
              "muchas veces"
            ],
            [
              "sometimes",
              "a veces"
            ],
            [
              "the first time",
              "la primera vez"
            ],
            [
              "how many times?",
              "¿cuántas veces?"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "_Twice a week_ = **dos veces a la semana**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "_Time_ as **duration** is **tiempo**: **no tengo tiempo**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
